2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     the block when a CLOSED FUT 15m bar breaks the recorded first-hour range by
2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     >= CHOP_REARM_BUFFER_PT (15pt) with body >= CHOP_REARM_BODY_MIN (65%), in the
2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     regime direction (BULL=>up-break only, BEAR=>down-break only, else either).
2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     FUT leads spot, so this triggers earlier than a spot-range break. Re-arm is
2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     one-way for the day (stays live once released); per-trade momentum/fade/CB
2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     guards still apply. _morning_chop_verdict_impl() stashes FH hi/lo;
2026-07-07 03:48:10,344 [INFO]     chop_rearm_check() evaluated each cycle while blocked. Logs [CHOPGATE] RE-ARMED.
